  <body>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="uva.00003.001.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <note type="archival" place="top" rend="circled">3</note>
   <lg type="poem">
   <head>
      <subst>
         <add seq="6" place="left" rend="underline">As I sit in twilight</add>
         <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">
            <hi rend="underline">As I sit in Twilight</hi>
         </del>
         <del seq="3" rend="overstrike">
            <add seq="2" place="above">you 
               <subst>
                  <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">countless</del>
                  <add place="below" seq="2">unknown</add>
               </subst>
               names.</add>
         </del>
         <add seq="4" place="below">
            <del rend="overstrike">you</del> Unknown names. 
            <del rend="overstrike">
         <note type="authorial">?</note> soldiers
      </del>
         </add>
      </subst>
   </head>
   
     <l>As I sit in twilight alone by the<lb/>
        flickering oak-flame,</l>
     <l>Musing on long-past war scenes&#8212;<add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a001">&#8212;the</add></del><del rend="overstrike">swarms</del><lb/>
        <del rend="overstrike">of</del>
        <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">&#8212;the <del seq="4" rend="overstrike">many,</del></add> <del rend="overstrike">vanish'd</del>
        <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add>
        <add place="above" xml:id="a003"><subst><del seq="1" rend="overstrike">myriad</del>
           <add place="below" seq="2">countless</add>
           <add seq="3" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add seq="3" place="above" xml:id="a004">countless</add>
        </subst>
        unknown buried 
        </add>
        soldiers</l>
     <l>The vacant names, the unindented air's and<lb/>
        seas, the unreturn'd from battles;</l>
     <l>The brief truce after, with grim burial<lb/>
        squads and hasty trenches</l>
     <l>(Even here in my room&#11840;shadows <subst>
        <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">in the</del>
        <add seq="2" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><add seq="2" place="above" xml:id="a005">and <subst>
           <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">silent</del> <add place="above" seq="2">noiseless</add></subst>
        </add>
     </subst>flick&#11840;<lb/>
        ering flames</l>
     <l>I see <subst>
        <add seq="2" place="below">
           <metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add seq="2" place="above" xml:id="a006">your</add></del> 
        <add place="above" seq="4">the</add>
        <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">the</del>
     </subst> 
        <subst>
           <del seq="1" rend="overstrik">ranks on&#11840;filing</del>
           <add seq="2" place="above">companies moving</add></subst>, I hear the rhythmic<lb/>
        tramp of the spectral armies,) <del rend="overstrike">move,)</del>
     </l>
     <l>
        <subst>
          <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">The</del>
          <add seq="2" place="above">You</add>
          <add seq="3" place="above"><note type="authorial">?</note>The</add>
        </subst>
         <subst>
            <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">mystic</del>
            <del seq="3"><add seq="2" place="above">countless</add></del>
         </subst>
        <add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a007">unknown ranks</add>
           <del rend="overstrike">names</del> from <add place="above" rend="marked">all</add> America, North,<lb/>
        South, East, West,</l>
     <l>From wooded Maine, New England's farms,<lb/>
        from fertile Pennsylvania,</l>
     <l>The <subst>
        <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">boundless</del>
        <add seq="2" place="above">measureless</add>
     </subst>
        West, the South, the Carolinas,<lb/>
        Texas</l>
     <l>
        <subst>
           <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">A</del>
           <add seq="2" place="above">You</add>
        </subst> 
        million unwrit names, all, all,
        <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a008">the dark bequest,</add> the war's<lb/>
        unknown,</l>
     <l>A special word 
        <subst>
           <del seq="1" rend="overstrike">for</del>
           <add seq="2" place="above">to</add>
        </subst>you&#8212;a flash of love&#8212;<add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add xml:id="a009" place="above" rend="marked">&#8212;<subst><del seq="1" rend="overstrike">the</del>
           <del seq="3" rend="overstrike">
              <add seq="2" place="above">&#8212;a</add>
           </del>
           <add seq="4" place="above">your</add>
        </subst> mystic roll 
           <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a010">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a010">strangely</add> completed <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a011">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a011">here</add>
        </add>
     </l>
     <l>Each name recall'd <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a012">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a012">by me</add> 
        from the darkness and 
        <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a013">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a013">Death's</add>
        ashes,</l>
     <l>
        <del rend="overstrike">Deep, deep,</del> 
        <subst rend="overwrite"><del>t</del><add>T</add></subst>o be to-night
        <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a014">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a014">deep, deep,</add> 
        within my thought
        <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a015">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a015">henceforth recorded,</add>,
        <del rend="overstrike">embalm'd</del></l>
     <l><del rend="overstrike">And 
        <subst>
           <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">recorded</del>
        <add place="above" seq="2">sounded</add>
        </subst>
        <subst>
           <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">in</del>
           <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a016">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" seq="2"> put within</add> <add place="above" seq="3">folded in</add></subst> these lines.</del></l>
     <l>Embalmed in this brief song.</l>
   </lg>
   
   <signed rend="underline">Walt Whitman</signed>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="uva_jc.00024_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
